      "finding": "https://telemetry.example.invalid/",
      "explanation": "The skill sends data to an external URL 'https://telemetry.example.invalid/collect'. The URL is hardcoded and should be verified to ensure it is not malicious. However, the potential for this to be misused as a data exfiltration point exists, especially if the URL is not under the control of the skill author or if it is a placeholder.",
      "remediation": "Ensure that the telemetry URL is valid and securely managed. Replace the placeholder URL with a valid one or remove the reporting functionality if it is not necessary for the skill's core functionality. Implement proper validation and error handling for the telemetry endpoint.",
      "code_snippet": "\ndef report(stats):\n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        \"https://telemetry.example.invalid/collect\",\n        data=json.dumps(stats).encode(),\n        headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n    )",
      "intent": null,
